      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3630252100840336,
        "y0": 0.22235716323671317,
        "x1": 0.7081003397452731,
        "y1": 0.23655573829052845
      },
      "text": "(which is clearly uniformly supported).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7244367327008928,
        "y0": 0.22235716323671317,
        "x1": 0.8813442711068803,
        "y1": 0.23655573829052845
      },
      "text": "By Theorem 3.15,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1191932485884979,
        "y0": 0.23903157648734408,
        "x1": 0.5023866797695641,
        "y1": 0.25323015154115947
      },
      "text": "there is a unique probability fam Ξ on 〈B₀",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5088408141576943,
        "y0": 0.23903157648734408,
        "x1": 0.671395284187894,
        "y1": 0.25323015154115947
      },
      "text": "∪ F 〉 extending Ξ₀",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6804709041819853,
        "y0": 0.23903157648734408,
        "x1": 0.8815465590533088,
        "y1": 0.25323015154115947
      },
      "text": "such that Ξ(b) = 1 for",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919329987854517,
        "y0": 0.25570591724966596,
        "x1": 0.45357948110884977,
        "y1": 0.26990449230348135
      },
      "text": "all b ∈ F, in particular, Ξ({0, 1}) = 1.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.46467182576155464,
        "y0": 0.25570591724966596,
        "x1": 0.7700170180376839,
        "y1": 0.26990449230348135
      },
      "text": "Then, Ξ({0}) = Ξ(a ∩ {0, 1}) = Ξ₀",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7710253803669905,
        "y0": 0.25570591724966596,
        "x1": 0.8188236525078781,
        "y1": 0.26990449230348135
      },
      "text": "(a) =",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8276974461659664,
        "y0": 0.25473810544772835,
        "x1": 0.8347562902113971,
        "y1": 0.2642037942120695
      },
      "text": "2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8276974974560136,
        "y0": 0.265284936954743,
        "x1": 0.8347563415014443,
        "y1": 0.27475062571908404
      },
      "text": "3",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.844235049977022,
        "y0": 0.25570635217952054,
        "x1": 0.8813441685267858,
        "y1": 0.2699049272333358
      },
      "text": "and,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919304342830882,
        "y0": 0.2733787119813317,
        "x1": 0.29001721293986343,
        "y1": 0.28757728703514696
      },
      "text": "naturally, Ξ({1}) =",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29949569061022846,
        "y0": 0.2725533397067471,
        "x1": 0.3065545090106355,
        "y1": 0.2820190284710882
      },
      "text": "1",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.299495793190323,
        "y0": 0.28309966379559803,
        "x1": 0.30655461159073005,
        "y1": 0.2925653525599391
      },
      "text": "3",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3085714131844144,
        "y0": 0.27337863949302255,
        "x1": 0.31401654411764707,
        "y1": 0.28757721454683793
      },
      "text": ".",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.32591562992384454,
        "y0": 0.27337863949302255,
        "x1": 0.881144137342437,
        "y1": 0.28757721454683793
      },
      "text": "However, Ξ cannot have the uap because no singleton can have",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919326141100972,
        "y0": 0.2911933663338777,
        "x1": 0.18897494788931196,
        "y1": 0.305391941387693
      },
      "text": "measure",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1996638706752232,
        "y0": 0.300771806132482,
        "x1": 0.20672268907563024,
        "y1": 0.31023749489682306
      },
      "text": "3",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.19966402454536503,
        "y0": 0.29036799405929314,
        "x1": 0.20672284294577206,
        "y1": 0.2998336828236342
      },
      "text": "2",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.21741209911699055,
        "y0": 0.29119322135725945,
        "x1": 0.7282686634224003,
        "y1": 0.30539179641107483
      },
      "text": "under a probability fam with the uap (by Theorem 2.18).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7429916766511292,
        "y0": 0.2911933663338777,
        "x1": 0.8809415416557248,
        "y1": 0.305391941387693
      },
      "text": "This also shows",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1191932485884979,
        "y0": 0.30772534005715557,
        "x1": 0.7274601784073004,
        "y1": 0.32192391511097085
      },
      "text": "that Theorem 3.8 is not valid in general when restricting to the uap:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7393597258239233,
        "y0": 0.3077254125454647,
        "x1": 0.8075294302291229,
        "y1": 0.32192398759928
      },
      "text": "both Ξ₀",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8166050502232143,
        "y0": 0.3077254125454647,
        "x1": 0.8694451853006828,
        "y1": 0.32192398759928
      },
      "text": "and Ξ",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8694450827205882,
        "y0": 0.3145960515581797,
        "x1": 0.8785207540047268,
        "y1": 0.3240617403225208
      },
      "text": "F",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919299213826155,
        "y0": 0.32425782119859714,
        "x1": 0.8813446814272584,
        "y1": 0.3384563962524124
      },
      "text": "are uniformly supported, but any common extension extends Ξ and thus cannot have the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919299213826155,
        "y0": 0.3409321619609189,
        "x1": 0.15630208504300158,
        "y1": 0.3551307370147343
      },
      "text": "uap.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919299213826155,
        "y0": 0.36416278032678895,
        "x1": 0.7895803243172269,
        "y1": 0.3783613553806042
      },
      "text": "We can validate Theorem 3.15 to fams with the uap under further conditions.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919327423352154,
        "y0": 0.3893879145171467,
        "x1": 0.7413781686991203,
        "y1": 0.403586489570962
      },
      "text": "Theorem 3.16. In Theorem 3.15, assume that B = P (X) and that B₀",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7496469193146008,
        "y0": 0.3893881319820739,
        "x1": 0.8813444762670694,
        "y1": 0.4035867070358893
      },
      "text": "contains all the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919314600840336,
        "y0": 0.4059200694611973,
        "x1": 0.327328106535583,
        "y1": 0.4201186445150126
      },
      "text": "finite subsets of X. If Ξ₀",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3339831953289128,
        "y0": 0.4059200694611973,
        "x1": 0.8815476874343487,
        "y1": 0.4201186445150126
      },
      "text": "has the uap, then so does Ξ. Likewise for “uniformly supported”.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1191932485884979,
        "y0": 0.4371315781690729,
        "x1": 0.3777475308971245,
        "y1": 0.45133015322288816
      },
      "text": "Proof. If all finite sets have Ξ₀",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3787559445164785,
        "y0": 0.4371315781690729,
        "x1": 0.8813450661026129,
        "y1": 0.45133015322288816
      },
      "text": "-measure zero, then the same is true for Ξ. So assume that",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919291520319066,
        "y0": 0.4536635156481963,
        "x1": 0.1393609824300814,
        "y1": 0.46786209070201157
      },
      "text": "Ξ₀",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1462182694122571,
        "y0": 0.4536635156481963,
        "x1": 0.5689403245429031,
        "y1": 0.46786209070201157
      },
      "text": "is uniformly supported with support P. Since B₀",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5759991301207983,
        "y0": 0.4536635156481963,
        "x1": 0.8811406496192227,
        "y1": 0.46786209070201157
      },
      "text": "contains all finite sets, all finite sets",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1191924279477416,
        "y0": 0.4701954531273196,
        "x1": 0.15589849648355436,
        "y1": 0.484394028181135
      },
      "text": "in P",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1661843564330029,
        "y0": 0.4701954531273196,
        "x1": 0.6752249453248096,
        "y1": 0.484394028181135
      },
      "text": "with positive measure must be singletons (by minimality).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6877294716714811,
        "y0": 0.4701954531273196,
        "x1": 0.881142803801208,
        "y1": 0.484394028181135
      },
      "text": "It is not hard to show",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919278697807248,
        "y0": 0.4868702650636505,
        "x1": 0.5846721745338761,
        "y1": 0.5010688401174659
      },
      "text": "that P is a support of Ξ, so Ξ is uniformly supported.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8454453925124737,
        "y0": 0.4911458429984412,
        "x1": 0.8805376838235294,
        "y1": 0.5053444180522566
      },
      "text": "3.16",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919310754086791,
        "y0": 0.5179391892675549,
        "x1": 0.8666217836011357,
        "y1": 0.5321377643213703
      },
      "text": "Similarly, we can validate the extension results when adding one set to the subalgebra.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1191930947183561,
        "y0": 0.5431646134111491,
        "x1": 0.8815466616334033,
        "y1": 0.5573631884649644
      },
      "text": "Lemma 3.17. In the context of Lemma 3.11, assume that B = P (X) and that C contains",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919365890887605,
        "y0": 0.5598391716383981,
        "x1": 0.27446589109276526,
        "y1": 0.5740377466922135
      },
      "text": "all the singletons.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.290018084870667,
        "y0": 0.5598391716383981,
        "x1": 0.5715636181230305,
        "y1": 0.5740377466922135
      },
      "text": "Then, if Ξ has the uap, then Ξ",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.571562951352416,
        "y0": 0.5592990771042197,
        "x1": 0.5753948820739233,
        "y1": 0.5687647658685607
      },
      "text": "′",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5854790695575105,
        "y0": 0.5598391716383981,
        "x1": 0.8236419421284139,
        "y1": 0.5740377466922135
      },
      "text": "can be found with the uap.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8393956288570116,
        "y0": 0.5598391716383981,
        "x1": 0.8813455020680147,
        "y1": 0.5740377466922135
      },
      "text": "As a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919335116859243,
        "y0": 0.5763711091175215,
        "x1": 0.8232613699776786,
        "y1": 0.5905696841713368
      },
      "text": "consequence, Ξ can be extended to a fam into K with the uap on the whole P (X).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919417180934874,
        "y0": 0.599601763727546,
        "x1": 0.8813461175485819,
        "y1": 0.6138003387813613
      },
      "text": "Here, “uap” can be replaced by “uniformly supported”, even more, extensions of Ξ can be",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919335116859243,
        "y0": 0.6161337012066694,
        "x1": 0.3680672268907563,
        "y1": 0.6303322762604847
      },
      "text": "found with the same support.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919335116859243,
        "y0": 0.6473452099145449,
        "x1": 0.8813438607865021,
        "y1": 0.6615437849683603
      },
      "text": "Proof. The result is trivial when all singletons have Ξ-measure zero. So assume that Ξ is",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919304342830882,
        "y0": 0.6638771473936684,
        "x1": 0.8813444762670694,
        "y1": 0.6780757224474836
      },
      "text": "uniformly supported. The argument in the proof of Lemma 3.11, when replacing A by a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919329987854517,
        "y0": 0.6805522492832357,
        "x1": 0.5786234879694065,
